      "title": "How to join a team",
      "steps": [
        "Open Modules in the WebUI header. Install and enable Team Workspace, then restart EMP if prompted.",
        "Open Team Workspace in the Services section and paste the full invitation from your administrator into the seven-digit join code field. If you only have the digits, select a nearby workspace or use the gear to enter its address.",
